('1630', 'C3556', 'Cond Rudá/Floresta-Sobrado 243 m2, 4 quartos(3stes), sacada, 2 vgs garagem.', 'xc3556', '7', '1', '', '<p>O sobrado novo está localizado no bairro Loteamento Floresta/Rudá possui 243 metros quadrados com 4 quartos sendo 3 suites e 5 banheiros, </p>\r\n<p>Possui área de lazer com academia, jardim, parquinho com diferentes brinquedos, espaço para festas.</p>\r\n<p>Vai lhe possibilitar curtir os dias mais quentes na piscina, praticar diversos esportes na quadra poliesportiva.Espaço reservado para preparar o seu churrasco.</p>\r\n<p>Condomínio R$310,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 1.jpg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 17.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 17.jpg\"},\"gallery18\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 18.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 18.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 13.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 2.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 3.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 12.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 16.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 16.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 4.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 5.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 14.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 9.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 15.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 15.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 11.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 7.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3556 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3556 8.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"p