('1668', 'C3581', 'Casa térrea reformada de 226m² com 3 dormitórios (1 suíte) e piscina no Jardim Bela Vista.', 'xc3581', '7', '1', '', '<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">- 3 dormitórios com piso de carpete(1 suíte)</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">- 1 wc social </p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">- Sala espaçosa</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">- Sala de jantar com armário de alvenaria</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">- Cozinha com armários</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">- Àrea de serviço </p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">- Depósito</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">- Banheiros com gabinete e box de vidro</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, Blink