('1669', 'A8026', 'Apartamento reformado e moderno de 75m² com 3 dormitórios (1 suíte) à venda no Jardim Petrópolis.', 'xa8026', '1', '1', '', '<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 3 dormitórios (1 suíte) </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- 1 wc social. </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">Banheiros com ducha, box até o teto e espelho com gabinete</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- Sala </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">ampla </span><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">2 ambientes </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">com iluminação em led, </span><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">integrada com a cozinha e varanda</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- Cozinha americana equipada com cooktop, forno, coifa e armários planejados</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- Área de serviço completa</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- Bancada da cozinha e área de serviço em quartzo branco</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">Sistema de aquecedor a gás em todas as torneiras e banheiros</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">- </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">Saídas de ar condicionado na sala e suíte</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">- </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">Móveis inclusos: Cozinha/lavanderia, Home da sala, roupeiro da suíte e armários dos banheiros</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">- Varanda</span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\"> com churrasqueira, vidro articulado e persiana solar; todas as janelas com rede de proteção</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">- Piso em porcelanato</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">- </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">Duas vagas de garagem no subsolo</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">O condomínio dispõe de segurança portaria virtual 24hrs, portões automáticos, 2 elevadores, academia, piscina adulto e infantil, churrasqueira, salão de festas, playground.</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/348478843885011.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"348478843885011.jpg\"},\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/168454365574815.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"168454365574815.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/345494604238825.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"345494604238825.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/340442249685141.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"340442249685141.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/346403725379977.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"346403725379977.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/349408125691831.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"349408125691831.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/349435001787696.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"349435001787696.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/348469367014912.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"348469367014912.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/344430365173804.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"344430365173804.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/343467487886625.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"343467487886625.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/344438727415996.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"344438727415996.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/524412362037408.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"524412362037408.jpg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/348486845947996.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"348486845947996.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/344482369030912.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"344482369030912.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/344474361896095.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"344474361896095.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/343437120455952.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"343437120455952.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/347450127030298.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"347450127030298.jpg\"}}', 'sell', '', '735000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'SJCampos', 'Jardim Petrópolis', '-23