('1677', 'A8030', 'Apartamento reformado de 55 m² com 2 dormitórios no Jardim Aquarius.', 'xa8030', '1', '1', '', '<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- 2 dormitórios</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- 1 wc social </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">com nicho, gabinete e ducha higiênica.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- Sala 2 ambientes integrada com a cozinha</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- Cozinha com bancada de granito, armário planejado e cooktop.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- 1 vaga de garagem</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">Porcelanato em todo o apartamento.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">- </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">Teto rebaixado com gesso</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">- A</span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">partamento recém reformado, t</span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">udo novo, luminárias, interruptores, p</span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">intura, fechadura eletrônica. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">- </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">Todas as louças são da Deca e os metais da Docol.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces; background-color: #ffffff;\">- Ótima localização no Aquarius.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Ro