ns-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">- Garagem fechada para 02 carros com hobby box </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">Aquecimento solar na casa atende quartos e cozinha.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: break-spaces;\">Lazer do condomínio: Quadras de tennis, quadra de areia e beach tennis, quadra de grama e piso, playground, academia, salão de festas e quiosque, pista de caminhada com extensa área verde de 3km.</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/128498364708634.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"128498364708634.jpg\"},\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/115480486141757.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"115480486141757.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/112417606273180.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"112417606273180.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/125494608208933.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"125494608208933.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/111419608281277.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"111419608281277.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/120424360965293.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"120424360965293.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/111486603135654.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"111486603135654.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/121492122537023.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"121492122537023.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/120418603077326.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"120418603077326.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/724498249847014.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"724498249847014.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/121499484717735.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"121499484717735.jpg\"}}', 'rent-sell', '', '3190000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'SJCampos'