('1696', 'A8038', 'Apartamento de 92m² com 3 dormitórios (2 suítes) em condomínio clube na Vila Sanches.', 'xa8038', '1', '1', '', '<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- 3 dormitórios (2 suítes)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- 1 wc social</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- Sala dois ambientes com varanda gourmet</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- Cozinha americana planejada com armários e cooktop.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- Área de serviço</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- 1 Vaga de garagem</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Lazer do condomínio: Piscina, quadra poliesportiva, salão de festas, brinquedoteca, sauna, academia, cinema, lan house, biblioteca, sala de reuniões, área gourmet com churrasqueiras, área arborizada. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Valor do condomínio: R$ 550,00</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7; color: #1a1d23; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica,