('1739', 'C3604', 'Res. Mantiqueira- Sobrado novo de 272 m2,  com 4 quartos(ste), sacada, lavabo, banh. serviço, 4 vgs', 'xc3604', '7', '1', '', '<p>Sobrado novo de condomínio sobrado no bairro Condomínio Residencial Mantiqueira com 272 metros quadrados com 4 quartos sendo 1 suite e 4 banheiros, ampla sala, sacada com vista livre, banh. de serviço, 4 vagas de garagem. </p>\r\n<p>Área comum no condomínio com playground, quiosque com churrasqueira, quadra poliesportiva, lindo lago para pesca esportiva, trilha de caminhada.<br /><span style=\"color: #50575a; font-family: Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase;\">CONDOMÍNIO / MÊS R$430,00</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 1.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 3.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 2.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 6.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 11.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 14.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 13.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 10.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 4.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 15.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 15.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 7.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 5.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 16.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 16.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 9.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3604 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3604 