('1767', 'A8066', 'Pq Industrial/ Maranata- Apto 55 m2 com 2 quartos(ste), arms, sacada, coz.plan, 1 vg gar', 'xa8066', '1', '1', '', '<p>O apartamento no bairro Pq Industrial. Cond. Maranata Pq Industrial, possui 55 m2 com 3 quartos sendo 1 suite e amários,  banheiro social e de serviço, sala com sacada, cozinha planejada, 1 vaga de garagem.</p>\r\n<p>Condomínio completo com: Mini mercado, Lavanderia, Car whash, Piscinas, Quadra, Sala de jogos, Diverteca, Academia, Pista de skate, Playground, Churrasqueiras, Salão de festas com área gourmet, Pet Space Coworking. Próximo ao Hospital Estadual</p>\r\n<p>Condomínio R$300,00   IPTU R$900,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8066 0.png\",\"alt_text\":\"A8066 0.png\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8066 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8066 1.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8066 1A.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8066 1A.jpeg\"}}', 'sell', '', '547000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'São José dos Campos', 'Parque Industrial', '-23.239673,-45.907961', '12235-649', '55', '2', '2', '1', '', '0', '[\"8\",\"9\",\"12\",\"16\",\"21\",\"22\",\"23\"]', '', '', '', '{}', '1', '*', '1', '0', '783', '2024-04-21 00:00:00', '783', '2024-10-24 10:38:13', '0', NULL),
('1768', 'A5627', 'Centro- Apto 56 m2 com 2 quartos(suite), sacada, 1 vaga garagem', 'xa5627', '1', '1', '', '<p>O apartamento está localizado no bairro Centro, condomínio San Giovanni com 56 m2 com 2 quartos sendo 1 suite, sala com sacada e sol da manhã, cozinha com armário, banheiro com box e 1 vaga de garagem. Tem elevador e portaria 24h.<br />Condomínio <a href=\"mailto:R@400,00\">R$400,00</a>      IPTU R$665,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 1.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 14.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 2.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 13.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 11.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 9.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 10.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 8.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 12.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 7.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 5.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 6.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 4.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A5627 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5627 3.jpg\"}}', 'sell', '', '360000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'São José dos Campos', 'Centro', '-23.189373,-45.887613', '12245-750', '56', '2', '2', '1', '', '0', '[\"22\"]', '', '', '', '{}', '0', '*', '1', '0', '783', '2024-04-22 00:00:00', '783', '2024-05-02 11:37:49', '0', NULL);/**ABDB**/
