('1772', 'A8069', 'Vila Adyana-Apto 76 m2/2 quartos, escttório, armários, coz.plan, 1 vg gar, salão festas, piscina', 'xa8069', '1', '1', '', '<p>O apartamento na Vila Adyana possui 76 m2 com 2 quartos sendo 1 suite, todos com armários, escritório, cozinha planejada, banheiro social com box/gabinete, 1 vaga de garagem.</p>\r\n<p>Possui playground, salão para festas e eventos,  piscina e churrasqueira e elevador. Portaria 24h. Ótima localização próximo ao Pq Santos Dumont, padarias, restaurantes, clínicas, e muitos outros serviços.<br />Condomínio R$740,00    IPTU R$640,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 1.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 11.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 5.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 2.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 3.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 6.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 13.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 10.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 4.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 7.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 12.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 8.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 14.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 9.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 15.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 15.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8069 16.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8069 16.jpg\"},\"gallery20\":{\