('1774', 'A8071', 'Apto 87 m2 - 2 quartos(suite), arms, sacada gourmet, coz.plan, 2 vg garagem, Lazer', 'xa8071', '1', '1', '', '<p>O apartamento no bairro Conjunto Residencial Trinta e Um de Março, Condominio Gold Park com 87 m2 com 2 quartos sendo 1 suite, todos com armários embutidos, sala com sacada gourmet, cozinha planejada, e 2 vagas de garagem</p>\r\n<p>Àrea de lazer com academia, playground, salão de festas e piscina. Elevador para mais praticidade no dia-a-dia.</p>\r\n<p>Espaço reservado para preparar o seu churrasco.</p>\r\n<p>Condomínioo R$488,00   IPTU R$1.200,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 1.jpg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 17.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 17.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 4.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 9.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 16.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 16.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 11.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 3.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 8.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 10.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 7.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 6.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 14.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 5.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 12.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 15.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 15.jpg\"},\"gallery20\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/A8071 20.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8071 20.jpg\"},\"gallery