('1780', 'C3616', 'Urbanova/Eldorado- Sobrado com 237 - 5 quartos(ste), coz.plan, sótãi, 2 vg garagem', 'xc3616', '7', '1', '', '<p>Sobrado no Urbanova, Condomínio Eldotado tem 237 m2 com 5 quartos sendo 1 suite, sala ampla com lavabo, cozinha planejada, quarto e banheiro de serviço, sótão, banheiro social com box/gabinete, 2 vagas cobertas de garagem. Ótima localização em rua sem saída, sem vizinho lateral e vista para a área verde do condomínio.</p>\r\n<p>Área de lazer do Condominio com playground, quadra polisesportiva e campo de futebol. Segurança 24h com portaria e vigilância.</p>\r\n<p>Condomínio R$300,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.47.08.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.47.08.jpeg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.53.34.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.53.34.jpeg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.49.32.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.49.32.jpeg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.53.11.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.53.11.jpeg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.47.30.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.47.30.jpeg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.50.46.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.50.46.jpeg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.53.51.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.53.51.jpeg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.47.53.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.47.53.jpeg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.52.11.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-13 at 16.52.11.jpeg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"imag