('1796', 'A8079', 'V. Zizinha/Res das Palmeiras-Apto 52 m2 com 2 quartos, gabinete de cozinha, banh box, 1 vaga garagem', 'xa8079', '1', '1', '', '<p>O apartamento está localizado na Vila Zizinha, Residencial das Palmeiras e  possui 52 m2 com 2 quartos, cozinha com gabinete, 1 banheiro com box, 1 vaga de garagem. Ótima localização, próximo ao Pq da Cidade, supermercado Cooper.<br />Condomínio R$423,00    IPTU R$415,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.57.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.57.jpeg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 7.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 7.jpeg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 5.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 5.jpeg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 3.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 3.jpeg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.57 1.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.57 1.jpeg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 1.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 1.jpeg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.57 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.57 2.jpeg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 2.jpeg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58.jpeg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 6.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2024-05-24 at 15.22.58 6.jpeg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/WhatsApp