('1807', 'A8083', 'Conj. Trinta e Um de Março/ Vila das Palmeiras- 48 m2 com 2 quartos, arms, coz.plan, 1 vg gar', 'xa8083', '1', '1', '', '<p>O apartamento está localizado no Conjunto Residencial Trinta e Um de Março, Condomínio Vila das Palmeiras com 48 m2 com 2 quartos + armários, cozinha planejada 1 banheiro com box/gabinete e 1 vaga de garagem.</p>\r\n<p>Possui academia, espaço para festas, parquinho infantil, espaço reservado para preparar o seu churrasco.<br />Condomínio 325,00    IPTU R$450,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/375487887134471.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"375487887134471.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/852443280147645.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"852443280147645.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/361415167266121.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"361415167266121.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/850466168235202.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"850466168235202.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/841412647640531.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"841412647640531.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/851495289455978.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"851495289455978.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/852435761587912.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"852435761587912.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/853425763723675.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"853425763723675.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/843449165203590.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"843449165203590.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/860496166697348.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"860496166697348.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/864498520137748.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"864498520137748.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/860448768557546.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"860448768557546.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/857474528095183.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"857474528095183.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/866495529951545.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"866495529951545.j