('1816', 'C3627', 'Pousada do Vale/Cond. Villagio do Lago- sobrado 70 m2 com 2 quartos(ste), sacada, 2 vgs gar', 'xc3627', '7', '1', '', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\">O sobrado geminado na Chácaras Pousada do Vale, Condomínio Village do Lago possui 70 m2 com 2 quartos com armários, cozinha planejada, sacada na 1 suite, banheiros com box/gabinete, e duas vagas de garagem. Próximo ao lago do bairro.<br /></span>Condomínio R$250,00   IPTU R$500,00 </p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 1.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 3.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 3.jpeg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 1.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 1.jpeg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 2.jpeg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 20.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 20.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 21.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 21.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 22.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 22.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 4.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 4.jpeg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 3.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 8.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 7.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 5.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 4.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 10.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 6.jpg\"},\"gallery20\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3627 14.jpg\"},\"gallery21\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3627 15.jpg\",\"alt_