('1817', 'A8091', 'Pq Industrial- Apto 58 m2 com 2 quartos(ste), arms, sacada, coz.plan, 1 vg gar e lazer completo', 'xa8091', '1', '1', '', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\">O imóvel no bairro Parque Industrial, Condominio Residencial Mediterrâneo tem 58 m2 com 2 quartos sendo 1 suite com armários, sala com sacada e sol da manhã, banheiros com box/gabinete, 1 vaga coberta de garagem.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\">Possui área de lazer completa com:  piscina, quadra, salão de festas, brinquedoteca, academia, bicicletário, garagem coberta /Excelente Localização,  Rua José Cobra Parque Industrial, próximo de tudo, farmácias, padarias, supermercados, posto de gasolina, hospitais, escolas.<br />Condomínio R$570,00    IPTU R$450,00</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 1.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 3.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 9.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 11.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 12.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 6.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 15.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 15.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 8.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 7.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 10.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 4.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 14.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8091 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8091 5.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images