('1834', 'A8100', 'Pq Resid Flamboyant-apto 56 m2 com 2 quartos(ste), coz.plan, sacada, 1 vg garagem', 'xa8100', '1', '1', '', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\">O apto no Parque Residencial Flamboyant tem 56 m2 com 2 quartos sendo 1 suite, armários, sala com sacada, banheiros com box/gabinete, 1 vaga de garagem.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\">Possui academia, playground, salão para festas e eventos.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\">Vai lhe possibilitar curtir os dias mais quentes na piscina, praticar diversos esportes na quadra poliesportiva, eChurrasqueira para você aproveitar nos momentos de descontração.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\">Elevador para mais praticidade no dia-a-dia e portaria 24h.<br /><br /><br />Condomínio R$330,00      IPTU R$850,00</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 1.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 2.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 8.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 12.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 7.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 10.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 11.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 3.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 5.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 6.jpg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 17.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 17.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 16.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8100 16.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8100 4.j