('1859', 'A8110', 'Pq Resid Flamboyant-apto 56 m2 com 2 quartos(ste), coz.plan, sacada, 1 vg garagem', 'xa8110', '1', '1', '', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\">O apto no Parque Residencial Flamboyant tem 56 m2 com 2 quartos sendo 1 suite, armários, sala com sacada, banheiros com box/gabinete, 1 vaga de garagem.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\">Possui academia, playground, salão para festas e eventos e brinquedoteca</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\">Vai lhe possibilitar curtir os dias mais quentes na piscina, praticar diversos esportes na quadra poliesportiva, eChurrasqueira para você aproveitar nos momentos de descontração.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.16px;\">Elevador para mais praticidade no dia-a-dia e portaria 24h.<br /><br />Condomínio R$365,00</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/576485062156997.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"576485062156997.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/564497789565590.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"564497789565590.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/563474904784474.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"563474904784474.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/568423429324858.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"568423429324858.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/578432788585697.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"578432788585697.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/578415660135316.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"578415660135316.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/571450425552527.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"571450425552527.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/573458665518020.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"573458665518020.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/578465668823944.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"578465668823944.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/576482303018200.jpg\",\"alt_te